      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "[video editing] Replace only the main woman in <Video 1> with the adult persona in <Picture 1>. Transfer her facial identity, hair and visible body proportions from the picture. Keep the source person's clothing and accessories; do not copy the reference outfit, background, pose or lighting.\nPreserve the source camera, scene, illumination, action order and timing. Let the persona perform the source person's head turns, expressions, gestures and interactions naturally. Retain every other person's own appearance and performance. In shots where the designated woman is absent, do not add the persona or transfer her features to another person. Preserve the original cuts.\nFollow the source's visible mouth movements, phrase starts and endings, pauses and laughter. Do not make listeners mouth an off-camera speaker's words. The final export uses the original soundtrack; do not change its dialogue.\nOmit creator-added captions, titles, subtitles and text stickers while retaining text physically present in the scene. Render natural colors and skin detail. Do not display the reference image or its background."
      ],
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
